  "bio": "Venture into the mesmerizing realm of LiLi LD Tattoo Art, where geometry meets skin in a symphony of intricate designs. Established in 1997 and nestled in the heart of l'hay-les-roses, France, this studio is a haven for those seeking precision and innovation in their ink. With a heritage of artistic excellence and a contemporary approach to design, LiLi LD is the pinnacle of geometric tattoo artistry.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: L'hay-les-roses, Ile-de-france, France"
